#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.bf_survey_question_move_view_form
msgid "Move"
msgstr "Déplacer"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
msgid "Move a section on its own, or questions on their own: a section moves with its own questions, and the others would land in the wrong section."
msgstr "Déplacez une section seule, ou des questions seules : une section part avec ses propres questions, et les autres tomberaient dans la mauvaise section."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.bf_survey_question_move_view_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.survey_survey_view_form_numbering
msgid "Move questions"
msgstr "Déplacer des questions"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_survey_numbering.model_bf_survey_question_move
msgid "Move survey questions to another section"
msgstr "Déplacer des questions d'un questionnaire vers une autre section"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:bf_survey_numbering.bf_survey_question_move_action
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.survey_survey_view_form_numbering
msgid "Move to another section"
msgstr "Déplacer vers une autre section"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_bf_survey_question_move__moves_section
msgid "Moves Section"
msgstr "Déplace une section"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_question__bf_number
msgid "Number"
msgstr "Numéro"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_survey__bf_numbering
msgid "Number sections and questions"
msgstr "Numéroter les sections et les questions"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_bf_survey_question_move__placement
msgid "Place"
msgstr "Placer"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
msgid "Questions can only be moved within one survey at a time."
msgstr "On ne déplace les questions que d'un seul questionnaire à la fois."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_survey_numbering.field_bf_survey_question_move__question_ids
msgid "Questions or sections to move. A section moves with all of its questions; the questions keep their order."
msgstr "Questions ou sections à déplacer. Une section se déplace avec toutes ses questions; les questions gardent leur ordre."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.survey_survey_view_form_numbering
msgid "Remove the typed numbers"
msgstr "Retirer les numéros tapés"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.survey_survey_view_form_numbering
msgid "Remove the typed numbers that repeat each line's own number, in every language? This cannot be undone; the rest of each title is kept."
msgstr "Retirer les numéros tapés qui répètent le numéro de chaque ligne, dans toutes les langues? C'est irréversible; le reste de chaque titre est gardé."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_survey__bf_typed_number_count
msgid "Sections and questions whose title already starts with a number typed by hand, which numbering would show twice."
msgstr "Sections et questions dont le titre commence déjà par un numéro tapé à la main, que la numérotation afficherait deux fois."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_survey__bf_numbering
msgid "Show a number before every section (1, 2, 3...) and every question (2.1, 2.2...), in the editor, the form the respondent fills in, the printed page and the results. A conditional question shown by an earlier question of the same section is numbered under it (2.12.1). Numbers follow the order of the questions: move one and the others renumber. The titles themselves are not changed."
msgstr "Affiche un numéro devant chaque section (1, 2, 3…) et chaque question (2.1, 2.2…), dans l'éditeur, le formulaire du répondant, la page imprimable et les résultats. Une question conditionnelle affichée par une question précédente de la même section est numérotée sous elle (2.12.1). Les numéros suivent l'ordre des questions : on en déplace une, les autres se renumérotent. Les titres eux-mêmes ne changent pas."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/models/survey_survey.py:0
msgid "Some typed numbers were kept"
msgstr "Des numéros tapés ont été gardés"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_survey_numbering.model_survey_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_bf_survey_question_move__survey_id
msgid "Survey"
msgstr "Questionnaire"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_survey_numbering.model_survey_question
msgid "Survey Question"
msgstr "Question du questionnaire"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
msgid "That question is not in the destination section."
msgstr "Cette question n'est pas dans la section de destination."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_question__bf_number
msgid "The section's or question's number, when the survey numbers its questions: 2 for a section, 2.1 for its first question, 2.1.1 for a conditional question shown by 2.1."
msgstr "Le numéro de la section ou de la question, quand le questionnaire numérote ses questions : 2 pour une section, 2.1 pour sa première question, 2.1.1 pour une question conditionnelle affichée par la 2.1."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/models/survey_survey.py:0
msgid ""
"These titles start with a number that is not their place in the survey, so it was left as typed. Correct them by hand:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Ces titres commencent par un numéro qui ne correspond pas à leur place dans le questionnaire : il a été laissé tel quel. Corrigez-les à la main :\n"
"%s"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
msgid ""
"This move would place a conditional question before the question that shows it, and the respondent would never see it:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Ce déplacement placerait une question conditionnelle avant la question qui l'affiche, et le répondant ne la verrait jamais :\n"
"%s"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/models/survey_survey.py:0
msgid "Tick “Number sections and questions” first: only the typed numbers that repeat the survey's own numbers are removed."
msgstr "Cochez d'abord « Numéroter les sections et les questions » : seuls les numéros tapés qui répètent ceux du questionnaire sont retirés."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.survey_survey_view_form_numbering
msgid "Titles that already start with a number typed by hand:"
msgstr "Titres qui commencent déjà par un numéro tapé à la main :"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_survey_survey__bf_typed_number_count
msgid "Titles with a typed number"
msgstr "Titres avec un numéro tapé"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_numbering.field_bf_survey_question_move__question_ids
msgid "To move"
msgstr "À déplacer"

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_survey_numbering.bf_survey_question_move_view_form
msgid ""
"response(s) to this survey are in progress. The new order applies to them\n"
"                    at once: a question moved into a section they have already passed will\n"
"                    not be shown to them."
msgstr "réponse(s) à ce questionnaire en cours. Le nouvel ordre s'applique à elles tout de suite : une question déplacée dans une section déjà passée ne leur sera pas montrée."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/wizard/survey_question_move.py:0
msgid "• “%(question)s” would come before “%(trigger)s”, which shows it."
msgstr "• « %(question)s » viendrait avant « %(trigger)s », qui l'affiche."

#. module: bf_survey_numbering
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_survey_numbering/models/survey_survey.py:0
msgid "… and %s more."
msgstr "… et %s autres."
